Modifications (2026, for DCR Job Walk): the package's CommonJS files were
merged into one ES module (index.js), only the WMM2025 coefficients were kept
and inlined, unused code was removed, the decimal-year calculation accounts
for leap years, the model's end date is NOAA's 2030.0, and helper functions
(declination, declinationInfo, decimalYear, isValidDate) were added. The
header of index.js lists every change.

The World Magnetic Model 2025 (WMM2025) coefficients and test values come from
NOAA's National Centers for Environmental Information (NCEI) and are in the
public domain: https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/world-magnetic-model
